  "summary": "學會問地點、聽懂左轉右轉和距離。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "這一課學什麼",
      "body": [
        "在國外迷路時，先說 Excuse me（不好意思），再問 Where is…?（…在哪裡？）。",
        "聽回答時抓三個重點：直走或轉彎、在什麼旁邊、要走多久。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "title": "聽聽看這段對話",
      "scene": "場景：在街上",
      "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-3/dialogue.mp3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "你",
          "side": "left",
          "en": "Excuse me. Where is the train station?",
          "zh": "不好意思，請問火車站在哪裡？",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-3/d1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "路人",
          "side": "right",
          "en": "Go straight and turn left at the second corner.",
          "zh": "直走，在第二個路口左轉。",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-3/d2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "你",
          "side": "left",
          "en": "Is it far from here?",
          "zh": "離這裡遠嗎？",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-3/d3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "路人",
          "side": "right",
          "en": "No. It's about five minutes on foot.",
          "zh": "不遠，走路大約五分鐘。",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-3/d4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "你",
          "side": "left",
          "en": "Is it next to the bank?",
          "zh": "在銀行旁邊嗎？",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-3/d5.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "路人",
          "side": "right",
          "en": "Yes, it's right next to the bank.",
          "zh": "對，就在銀行旁邊。",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-3/d6.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "你",
          "side": "left",
          "en": "Thank you so much!",
          "zh": "非常謝謝你！",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-3/d7.mp3"
        }
      ]
